# K03 S5 (Codex K03-S5-DEFINITION-TAIL-20261007-03): x, absent in the body of Outer, retains `sendMessage:
# exit(...)` as the body of a nested Structure x; running Outer runs none of it (exit 4 if it did): exit 7.
Outer:
    size_t: k 1U
    x: sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 4; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
end: Outer
Outer()
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: 7; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
